"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5020680","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4349020-1846651706680216","game_id":"steam-4349020","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: New Areas, Capsule Arts, Reworked Gilman Estate & Bug Fixes","summary":"18,000 Wishlists. Thank You!Before anything else: Late Night Manifest just passed 18,000 wishlists! We're a tiny indie team, and seeing that many of you waiting to step into Hillwich District means more than we can put into words. Every wishlist, every comment and every bug report has helped shape this game. Thank you. With this update, the demo is ready for Steam Next Fest (October 19–26). Here's what's new. Three New AreasThe darkness just got bigger. Shadehorn Grove (also known as the Forest)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:07:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680216","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4349020-1840944183787940","game_id":"steam-4349020","kind":"announcement","title":"Fine-Tuning the Demo Experience","summary":"Late Night Manifest - Development UpdateI’ve been spending the last few weeks polishing Late Night Manifest and, this time, a lot of the work has been focused on the small details that can make a surprisingly big difference in how the game feels.Some of these changes may not look very significant on their own, but together they help make the controls more predictable, reduce unnecessary backtracking, improve readability, and make exploration feel smoother.Here’s what I’ve been working on. 🎮More ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T06:06:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787940","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4349020-1840310314347567","game_id":"steam-4349020","kind":"announcement","title":"The Late Night Manifest Demo is OUT NOW!","summary":"After a longer wait than I originally planned, Late Night Manifest's demo is finally available!I originally planned to release the demo on August 1st, but during the final testing phase I ran into some major bugs that I simply couldn't ignore. On top of that, the Steam review process took longer than expected.So the release was delayed but better late than broken. 😄I'm really happy that I can finally put the demo in your hands.What's included in the Demo?The full game is planned to have 6 differ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T14:41:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347567","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4349020-1837955055360776","game_id":"steam-4349020","kind":"announcement","title":"Awakening In The Coffin","summary":"First of all, I want to start by saying a massive thank you. We are incredibly close to hitting 17,000 wishlists! Seeing this level of support for Late Night Manifest is mind-blowing. It truly fuels the dark machinery behind the scenes and keeps us going.So, where are we at right now? Here is a quick look at the current state of development and what we have been working on: Closed Playtests Have BegunI have officially kicked off closed playtests with a select group of content creators. Watching ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T09:21:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055360776","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4349020-1834602721193389","game_id":"steam-4349020","kind":"announcement","title":"Signals Behind The Walls","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome back to another update on Late Night Manifest!Honestly, this game occupies my mind from the moment I wake up until the late hours of the night. Today, I'm thrilled to share some big milestones, a look into my design philosophy, a glimpse of what's waiting for you inside the house, and some massive news regarding the upcoming demo.1. Retro Machinery & Concrete ControlsAs I've hinted before, radiation, old frequencies, and strange radio technologies play a massive role ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T09:57:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721193389","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4349020-1832065502817635","game_id":"steam-4349020","kind":"announcement","title":"Frequency Of The Unknown","summary":"Hey everyone!Welcome to the fourth monthly devlog for Late Night Manifest. I'm excited to share what I've been diving into lately and what's on the horizon for the project. First off, a massive thank you to everyone who's been following these updates and hitting that wishlist button. Your support is a huge personal motivator for me. We just hit a major milestone of 14,000 wishlists, and seeing the community grow like this makes me even more confident about where we're headed. Let's get into what","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-09T14:41:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502817635","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4349020-1829528821312552","game_id":"steam-4349020","kind":"announcement","title":"Manifest Takes Form","summary":"Hey everyone!Welcome to my third monthly devlog for Late Night Manifest. Here's a look at what I have been working on recently and what’s coming next.First of all, thank you to everyone who has taken the time to read these updates and added the game to their wishlist. Your support truly means a lot and keeps me motivated to keep pushing the project forward. We've now reached 9.000 wishlists, and with your continued support, I'm confident we can go even further.Gameplay UpdatesA new storage syste","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-11T17:17:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821312552","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4349020-1826362059927330","game_id":"steam-4349020","kind":"announcement","title":"Basic Pocket System","summary":"Hello everyone!It’s been about a month since my last devlog. During this time I’ve made significant progress on the core gameplay mechanics of the game.First of all, thank you very much to everyone who has taken the time to read these updates and added the game to their wishlist. Your support really means a lot and helps motivate me to keep pushing the project forward. We've reached 5,000 wishlists so far. With your support, I believe we can go much further. In this devlog, I’d like to walk you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-07T19:45:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059927330","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4349020-1823825466495146","game_id":"steam-4349020","kind":"announcement","title":"The First \"Morning\"","summary":"Hey everyone! First of all, thank you for adding my game into your wishlist. I'm doing my best to create a game worthy of everyone who adds it to their wishlist. Every day, during my morning walks, in my mind, I do pre-feasibility studies on the game's story and the mechanics I'll add.At the moment, development is on the interior of the house. I’ve started building small, subtle interactions inside this space, nothing flashy, but elements meant to ground the player and slowly introduce the tone ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-04T21:57:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466495146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4349020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:23Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4349020":"2026-10-26T12:08:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4349020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:23Z"},"5020680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:24Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4349020","app_id":4349020,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"838c09ea703ee4b5363065fa74a40cfe47950dd1aa441ec6205f222b019a7444","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"마르코가 되어 어둠에 뒤덮인 현실에서 깨어난 당신은, 버려진 어둠 속에서 해답을 찾으며 생존을 위해 싸워야 합니다. 당신은 혼자가 아닐지도 모릅니다. 탐험과 퍼즐을 통해 진실을 밝혀내고, 치명적인 위험을 극복하여 다른 생존자들을 찾아야 합니다.","publishers